{"1301730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Raid on the Zone", "steam_appid": 1301730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301730/extras/14efda99853ba17f65280960a3020809.poster.avif?t=1726219177\" width=616 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301730/extras/14efda99853ba17f65280960a3020809.webm?t=1726219177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301730/extras/14efda99853ba17f65280960a3020809.mp4?t=1726219177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Bring the battle to the mysterious terrorist organization dubbed The Zone, and race against the clock to stop their plans on unleashing a devastating biological weapon upon the world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301730/extras/86b45949781d5fd44d2f33c76bdf2cb4.avif?t=1726219177\" width=616 height=108 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301730/extras/e99fb04369a00ab435116c3a2e71d131.poster.avif?t=1726219177\" width=616 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301730/extras/e99fb04369a00ab435116c3a2e71d131.webm?t=1726219177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301730/extras/e99fb04369a00ab435116c3a2e71d131.mp4?t=1726219177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Pilot your unique dual-ducted fan combat helicopter to seek and destroy The Zone’s factories, air defenses and land forces while providing protection to your own aircraft carrier from brutal retaliatory attacks.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301730/extras/403f255d66bf791273ea3307af12ea1d.avif?t=1726219177\" width=616 height=108 /></span><br>Raid on the Zone is a tribute to the classic arcade games of the 80’s, featuring retro-inspired top-down 2D graphics in a procedurally generated gameworld. Your helicopter can be equipped with an arsenal of deadly weapons and countermeasures. But The Zone have nastry tricks up their sleeves and devastating weaponry of their own including anti-aircraft guns, missiles, radar jammers, fighter jets, bombers, tanks, and more.<br><br>This game isn't easy! So to help you in your assignment, you will be able to buy upgrades which greatly enhances your chances of success!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301730/extras/4826910b08c9d2537701fd16a5fcf46c.avif?t=1726219177\" width=616 height=108 /></span><br>The Zone is active on all fronts, requiring your attention and trigger finger to be ready at all times.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Attack and destroy facilities on land to slow The Zone’s ability to construct their deadly super weapon<br></li><li>Destroy runways to prevent enemy planes from entering the fight<br></li><li>Take out enemy boats in the sea to prevent them from targeting and attacking your aircraft carrier, your hub for rearming and repairs<br></li><li>Protect civilians from both enemy and friendly fire<br></li><li>Put a final end to The Zone by finding and destroying their super weapon factory</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301730/extras/14efda99853ba17f65280960a3020809.poster.avif?t=1726219177\" width=616 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301730/extras/14efda99853ba17f65280960a3020809.webm?t=1726219177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301730/extras/14efda99853ba17f65280960a3020809.mp4?t=1726219177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Bring the battle to the mysterious terrorist organization dubbed The Zone, and race against the clock to stop their plans on unleashing a devastating biological weapon upon the world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301730/extras/86b45949781d5fd44d2f33c76bdf2cb4.avif?t=1726219177\" width=616 height=108 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301730/extras/e99fb04369a00ab435116c3a2e71d131.poster.avif?t=1726219177\" width=616 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301730/extras/e99fb04369a00ab435116c3a2e71d131.webm?t=1726219177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301730/extras/e99fb04369a00ab435116c3a2e71d131.mp4?t=1726219177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Pilot your unique dual-ducted fan combat helicopter to seek and destroy The Zone’s factories, air defenses and land forces while providing protection to your own aircraft carrier from brutal retaliatory attacks.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301730/extras/403f255d66bf791273ea3307af12ea1d.avif?t=1726219177\" width=616 height=108 /></span><br>Raid on the Zone is a tribute to the classic arcade games of the 80’s, featuring retro-inspired top-down 2D graphics in a procedurally generated gameworld. Your helicopter can be equipped with an arsenal of deadly weapons and countermeasures. But The Zone have nastry tricks up their sleeves and devastating weaponry of their own including anti-aircraft guns, missiles, radar jammers, fighter jets, bombers, tanks, and more.<br><br>This game isn't easy! So to help you in your assignment, you will be able to buy upgrades which greatly enhances your chances of success!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301730/extras/4826910b08c9d2537701fd16a5fcf46c.avif?t=1726219177\" width=616 height=108 /></span><br>The Zone is active on all fronts, requiring your attention and trigger finger to be ready at all times.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Attack and destroy facilities on land to slow The Zone’s ability to construct their deadly super weapon<br></li><li>Destroy runways to prevent enemy planes from entering the fight<br></li><li>Take out enemy boats in the sea to prevent them from targeting and attacking your aircraft carrier, your hub for rearming and repairs<br></li><li>Protect civilians from both enemy and friendly fire<br></li><li>Put a final end to The Zone by finding and destroying their super weapon factory</li></ul>", "short_description": "Fight in a furious battle against “The Zone”, a mysterious terrorist group hell-bent on destroying the world. Cripple their defenses with your dual-prop helicopter and massive arsenal of weaponry in this retro-inspired homage to arcade games of the 80’s.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301730/header.jpg?t=1726219177", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301730/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1726219177", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301730/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1726219177", "website": "https://petskullgames.com", "pc_requirements": {"mi